OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform councillor charged with
OL,4,Adangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been
OL,7,Fsuspended from the party after he was
OL,8,Fcharged with a series of driving
OL,9,Foffences.
OL,11,FLawrence Davies, 54, of Moredon, is set
OL,12,Fto appear at Swindon Magistrates' Court
OL,13,Fon 24 September after being charged
OL,14,Fwith dangerous driving, failing to stop
OL,15,Fafter a road collision and driving
OL,16,Fwithout insurance, Wiltshire Police
OL,17,Fhave said.
OL,19,FThe charges relate to an incident
OL,20,Freported on 13 April on Kingsdown Road
OL,21,Fin Swindon.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
