OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform councillor charged with
OL,4,Adangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Swindon Borough Council councillor
OL,7,Fwas suspended from Reform UK on
OL,8,FWednesday, but he told the BBC he had
OL,9,Falready resigned before the suspension.
